precedence over you; and if Allāh had willed [to send a messenger], He would have sent down angels. We have not heard of this among our forefathers.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"23:25","t":"He is not but a man possessed with madness, so wait concerning him for a time.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"23:26","t":"[Noah] said, \"My Lord, support me because they have denied me.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"23:27","t":"So We inspired to him, \"Construct the ship under Our observation and Our inspiration, and when Our command comes and the oven overflows, put into it [i.e., the ship] from each [creature] two mates and your family, except him for whom the decree [of destruction] has proceeded. And do not address Me concerning those who have wronged; indeed, they are to be drowned.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":27,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":35,"surahs":[23],"sajdah":false}